# Music Data Platform configuration example. No credentials are included.
# Copy only the variables required by your selected services into your environment.
# Blank means unset; do not export all blank values because that overrides code defaults.
# Local development: bash ops/local/up.sh supplies disposable synthetic configuration.
# Deployment: use your own Fly organization/apps and provider accounts.
# SECRET_STORE_PROJECT and SECRET_STORE_CONFIG are optional secret-manager selectors, with no inherited project.
# FLY_APP_* map logical mdp service names in templates to your provisioned app names.
# Database role names such as dbt_transform are local least-privilege schema contracts.

